<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav M1 money supply rises in May vs April.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav M1 money supply rises in May vs April.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia</p>
<p>reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY</p>
<p> (in billions of dinars)    MAY	APRIL    MAY 96</p>
<p> M1			     5.933	5.562     3.851</p>
<p> M2			     7.989	7.571     5.418</p>
<p> M3			    33.345     32.841    28.707</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 311 4305</p>
</text>
